Error [E0204]: `total` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/lambda_mut_borrow_conflict.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     total+= 1
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: while something is being changed, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: pass `&total` only once, or copy first with `total.clone()`
